      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[ &hellip; and you shall] lie down, and none shall make you afraid, and many shall entreat your favor (Job 11:19).</li>\n<li>For the Lord shall be your confidence and shall keep your foot from being caught (Prov. 3:26).</li>\n<li>The Lord shall keep you from all evil; He shall keep your soul.</li>\n<li>The Lord shall keep your going out and your coming in from this time forth and</li>\n<li>forevermore (Ps. 121:7&ndash;8).&nbsp;For length of days and years of life and peace</li>\n<li>shall they add to you (Prov. 3:2).&nbsp;And you shall find favor and good understanding in the sight of God</li>\n<li>and man (Prov. 3:4).</li>\n<li>The slave of his excellency our ga\u02beon, may his majesty be exalted and his honor increased, [&hellip;], reports to</li>\n<li>his loftiness, may God perpetuate his majesty, what the excellency already knows</li>\n<li>regarding the affair of Ab\u016b l-\u1e24asan al-\u1e6ca\u1e25\u1e25\u0101n (the miller) in al-[Q]\u0101hira al-Mu\u02bfizziyya (Cairo). She asks</li>\n<li>and implores before him that, if a contract (kit\u0101b) is concluded between them, it should contain these</li>\n<li>conditions as a safeguard against its consequences and against the mischief (<i>gh\u0101\u02beila</i>) of his family t[oward her]:</li>\n<li>that she shall have ne\u02beemanut (trusted status) fully and completely, binding on him and on [his] h[eirs]</li>\n<li>after him. .. She is to reside in Mi\u1e63r [Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d] until Passover. He has said that he wants</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; ] and he has not specified anything for me, nor has he paid anything of what is need[ed]</li>\n<li>[fo]r it by way of upkeep [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; ] her hands and [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>its cost, not I [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>the generous [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li>[ &hellip; ]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
